# Bootstrap 🎨

## What is Bootstrap?
**Bootstrap** is a popular **CSS framework** used to build responsive and mobile-friendly websites quickly.

### Add Bootstrap (CDN)

```html
<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
```

### Example

```html
<button class="btn btn-primary">Click Me</button>
```

## Key Points
- Provides **pre-built CSS components**.
- Creates **responsive** web pages.
- Includes buttons, forms, cards, navbar, and more.
- Saves development time..........                                                                   
